flowchart TB
  accTitle: Decoder send and receive state machine
  accDescr: Retry the same packet after receiving available frames on EAGAIN. At input EOF, send the flush marker and drain until decoder EOF.
  Read["Read next packet"] --> Send["Send packet"]
  Send -->|"accepted"| Receive["Receive frames until EAGAIN"]
  Send -->|"EAGAIN"| Drain["Receive available frames"] -->|"retry same packet"| Send
  Receive --> Read
  Read -->|"input EOF"| Flush["Send flush marker"] --> Final["Receive delayed frames until decoder EOF"]
  Send -->|"other error"| Fail["Fail; do not publish partial success"]
